#: src/views/dashboard_view.rs:588
msgid ""
"When RAM is full the kernel may kill applications. Enable disk swap for a "
"reliable safety net."
msgstr ""
"Når RAM er fyldt, kan kernen dræbe programmer. Aktiver disk-swap for et "
"pålideligt sikkerhedsnet."

